Litterbox usage and maintenance
IsTracker(url string) (bool, string) matches URLs case-insensitively and returns
the upstream vendor name (Mailchimp is named Intuit). When multiple vendors
match, the first vendor in lexicographic order wins. No network access occurs.
IsTinyOrHidden(attrs map[string]string) checks width/height attributes and
inline CSS: dimensions from 0 through 2 pixels, display:none, visibility:hidden,
and opacity:0. This heuristic can classify decorative spacer images as tiny.
It does not compute stylesheet rules or inherited styles; callers must evaluate
those separately when needed. Call both helpers before fetching image content.

Run python3 tools/update_trackers.py from the repository root to regenerate the
data snapshot from the pinned upstream commit. To update the source version,
change COMMIT in that script and review the generated data and license together.
Run cd server && go test ./internal/mailhtml/trackers/ to exercise matching.
